---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
 
<Layout
  title="Weight Loss Calorie Calculator - Calculate Your Deficit | CalorieAce"
  description="Calculate exactly how many calories to eat per day to lose weight safely. Get a personalized calorie deficit, weight loss timeline, and meal plan based on your age, weight, height, and activity level."
>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
 
    <!-- ============ SECTION 1: PAGE HEADER (SEO: H1 + intro copy) ============ -->
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-charcoal leading-tight">
      Weight Loss <span class="text-forest">Calorie Calculator</span>
    </h1>
 
    <p class="mt-3 font-body text-lg text-gray-soft max-w-lg">
      Find out exactly how many calories you should eat per day to lose weight safely and sustainably.
    </p>
 
    <section class="mt-8 p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_2px_24px_rgba(26,26,24,0.06)] border border-forest-light" aria-label="Weight loss calorie calculator form">
 
      <!-- ============ SECTION 2: CALCULATOR FORM ============ -->
      <form id="calorie-form" class="space-y-4">
 
        <!-- Metric / Imperial toggle -->
        <div class="flex gap-1 p-1 bg-forest-light rounded-full">
          <button type="button" id="unit-metric-btn" class="unit-toggle-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full bg-forest text-cream transition-colors">Metric (Kg / Cm)</button>
          <button type="button" id="unit-imperial-btn" class="unit-toggle-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full text-gray-soft transition-colors">Imperial (Lb / Ft)</button>
        </div>
 
        <!-- Gender -->
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-soft uppercase">Biological Sex</label>
          <div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" id="gender-male-btn" class="gender-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest text-cream transition-colors">Male</button>
            <button type="button" id="gender-female-btn" class="gender-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest-light text-charcoal transition-colors">Female</button>
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" id="gender" value="male" />
        </div>
 
        <div>
          <label for="age" class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">Age (years)</label>
          <input type="number" id="age" value="25" min="1" max="120" inputmode="numeric" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
        </div>
 
        <div>
          <label for="weight" class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">
            Weight (<span id="weight-unit-label">kg</span>)
          </label>
          <input type="number" id="weight" value="70" min="1" inputmode="decimal" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
        </div>
 
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80" id="height-label">Height (cm)</label>
 
          <div id="height-cm-input" class="mt-1.5">
            <input type="number" id="height" value="170" min="1" inputmode="decimal" class="block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
          </div>
 
          <div id="height-ftin-input" class="mt-1.5 hidden grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-soft">Feet</span>
              <input type="number" id="height-feet" min="0" value="5" inputmode="numeric" class="mt-0.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-soft">Inches</span>
              <input type="number" id="height-inches" min="0" max="11" value="7" inputmode="numeric" class="mt-0.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
 
        <div>
          <label for="activity" class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">Activity Level</label>
          <select id="activity" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest">
            <option value="1.2">Sedentary (little or no exercise)</option>
            <option value="1.375">Light (exercise 1-3 days/week)</option>
            <option value="1.55">Moderate (exercise 3-5 days/week)</option>
            <option value="1.725">Active (exercise 6-7 days/week)</option>
            <option value="1.9">Very Active (hard exercise daily)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
 
        <div>
          <label for="deficit" class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">Weight Loss Speed</label>
          <select id="deficit" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest">
            <option value="250">Gradual (0.25 kg/week)</option>
            <option value="500" selected>Moderate (0.5 kg/week) - Recommended</option>
            <option value="750">Fast (0.75 kg/week)</option>
            <option value="1000">Aggressive (1 kg/week)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
 
        <button type="submit" class="touch-manipulation w-full bg-forest text-cream font-body font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-forest-dark transition-colors">
          Calculate My Weight Loss Calories
        </button>
      </form>
 
      <!-- ============ SECTION 3: CALCULATOR RESULT ============ -->
      <div id="result" class="mt-8 hidden scroll-mt-24">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="relative w-40 h-40">
            <svg class="w-full h-full -rotate-90" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="none" stroke="#E8F0E9" stroke-width="8" />
              <circle
                id="gauge-circle"
                cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="none"
                stroke="#2F6B4F" stroke-width="8"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-dasharray="264"
                stroke-dashoffset="264"
                style="transition: stroke-dashoffset 1s ease-out;"
              />
            </svg>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
              <span id="result-value" class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-forest">0</span>
              <span class="font-body text-xs text-gray-soft mt-1">calories/day</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-gray-soft text-center">to lose weight</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 bg-forest-light rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-soft uppercase">Maintenance Level</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-charcoal"><span id="maintenance-value">0</span> cal/day</p>
        </div>
      </div>
 
      <!-- ============ SECTION 4: ROADMAP CTA (shown only after a calculation) ============ -->
      <div id="roadmap-cta" class="mt-6 hidden p-5 bg-forest-light rounded-xl border border-forest-light">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-forest">Want a Personalized Roadmap?</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-charcoal/70">
          You already know your daily calorie target. Get a step-by-step plan to reach your goal.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-charcoal/70 space-y-0.5">
          <li>✓ Personalized meal plan</li>
          <li>✓ Weight milestones</li>
          <li>✓ Estimated timeline</li>
          <li>✓ Progress tracker</li>
        </ul>
        <button type="button" id="roadmap-cta-btn" class="touch-manipulation mt-4 w-full bg-forest text-cream font-body font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-forest-dark transition-colors">
          Create My Roadmap
        </button>
      </div>
 
      <!-- ============ SECTION 5: ROADMAP INTAKE (only new questions) ============ -->
      <div id="roadmap-intake" class="mt-6 hidden p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-forest-light">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-forest">A couple more details</h3>
 
        <div class="mt-3">
          <label for="roadmap-target-weight" class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">
            Target Weight (<span id="roadmap-target-weight-unit-label">kg</span>)
          </label>
          <input type="number" id="roadmap-target-weight" min="1" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 65" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
          <p id="roadmap-target-weight-error" class="mt-1 font-body text-xs text-amber-600 hidden">
            Enter a target weight lower than your current weight.
          </p>
          <p id="roadmap-target-weight-danger" class="mt-1 font-body text-xs text-red-600 font-medium hidden">
            This target isn't medically safe to plan for. Please consult a doctor or registered dietitian before pursuing a weight-loss goal this extreme.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <label for="roadmap-timeframe" class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">
            Timeframe (weeks) <span class="font-normal text-charcoal/50">— optional</span>
          </label>
          <input type="number" id="roadmap-timeframe" min="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 12" class="mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-200 bg-cream focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest" />
          <p class="mt-1 font-body text-xs text-charcoal/50">
            Leave blank to use the pace from your deficit choice above.
          </p>
          <p id="roadmap-timeframe-warning" class="mt-1 font-body text-xs text-amber-600 hidden"></p>
        </div>
 
        <div class="mt-4">
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">Diet preference</label>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" id="diet-veg-btn" class="diet-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest text-cream transition-colors">Vegetarian</button>
            <button type="button" id="diet-nonveg-btn" class="diet-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest-light text-charcoal transition-colors">Non-vegetarian</button>
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" id="diet-preference" value="veg" />
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">Meal style</label>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" id="region-asian-btn" class="region-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest text-cream transition-colors">Asian</button>
            <button type="button" id="region-western-btn" class="region-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest-light text-charcoal transition-colors">Western</button>
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" id="meal-region" value="asian" />
        </div>
 
        <div class="mt-4">
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-charcoal/80">Meals per day</label>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" id="meals-3-btn" class="meals-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest text-cream transition-colors">3 meals</button>
            <button type="button" id="meals-4-btn" class="meals-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest-light text-charcoal transition-colors">4 meals</button>
            <button type="button" id="meals-5-btn" class="meals-btn touch-manipulation flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm bg-forest-light text-charcoal transition-colors">5 meals</button>
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" id="meals-per-day" value="3" />
        </div>
 
        <button type="button" id="roadmap-generate-btn" class="touch-manipulation mt-4 w-full bg-forest text-cream font-body font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-forest-dark transition-colors">
          Generate My Roadmap
        </button>
      </div>
 
      <!-- ============ SECTION 6: ROADMAP RESULT PANEL ============ -->
      <div id="roadmap-panel" class="mt-6 hidden p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-forest-light">
        <button type="button" id="roadmap-back-btn" class="touch-manipulation font-body text-sm text-forest hover:underline">&larr; Back to Calculator</button>
 
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Your Weight Loss Roadmap</h3>
        <p id="rm-warning" class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-amber-600 hidden"></p>
 
        <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 font-body text-sm">
          <div class="bg-forest-light rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-soft uppercase">Current</p>
            <p id="rm-current" class="font-semibold text-charcoal"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-forest-light rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-soft uppercase">Target</p>
            <p id="rm-target" class="font-semibold text-charcoal"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-forest-light rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-soft uppercase">Total to lose</p>
            <p id="rm-total" class="font-semibold text-charcoal"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-forest-light rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-soft uppercase">Est. timeframe</p>
            <p id="rm-timeframe" class="font-semibold text-charcoal"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-forest-light rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-soft uppercase">Daily calories</p>
            <p id="rm-calories" class="font-semibold text-charcoal"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-forest-light rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-soft uppercase">Daily protein</p>
            <p id="rm-protein" class="font-semibold text-charcoal"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
 
        <h4 class="mt-5 font-heading font-semibold text-charcoal">Milestones</h4>
        <ul id="rm-milestones" class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-charcoal/80 space-y-1"></ul>
 
        <h4 class="mt-5 font-heading font-semibold text-charcoal">Sample Meal Plan</h4>
        <div id="rm-mealplan" class="mt-2 font-body text-sm text-charcoal/80 space-y-3"></div>
 
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-xs text-gray-soft">
          These numbers are estimates for general informational purposes, not medical advice. For extreme goals or health conditions, please consult a qualified healthcare professional or registered dietitian.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-xs text-gray-soft">
          Calorie estimates use the Mifflin-St Jeor equation, published in the
          <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2305711/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-forest">American Journal of Clinical Nutrition (1990)</a>.
        </p>
 
        <!-- Track Progress now lives on its own page: /progress -->
        <a href="/progress" class="touch-manipulation mt-6 block text-center w-full bg-forest-light text-forest-dark font-body font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-forest hover:text-cream transition-colors">
          Track Your Progress →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
 
    <!-- ============ SECTION 7: HERO IMAGE ============ -->
     <img
      src="/weight-loss.webp"
      alt="Illustration representing healthy weight loss through calorie deficit"
      class="w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto rounded-2xl mt-10"
      width="1200"
      height="630"
      loading="lazy"
    />
 
    <!-- ============ SECTION 8: HOW IT WORKS (SEO content) ============ -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">
        How this calculator works
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 font-body text-gray-soft">
        We first calculate your maintenance calories (TDEE) using the Mifflin-St Jeor formula, then subtract your chosen daily deficit. A deficit of 500 calories per day is the most commonly recommended pace, leading to about 0.5 kg of weight loss per week.
      </p>
    </section>
 
    <!-- ============ SECTION 9: FAQ (SEO content + schema) ============ -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
 
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-2" id="faq-accordion">
        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>How many calories should I cut to lose weight?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              A deficit of 300 to 500 calories below your maintenance level per day is considered safe and sustainable for most people.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
 
        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>How long does it take to lose 1 kg?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              Since 1 kg of body fat is roughly 7,700 calories, a 500-calorie daily deficit takes about 15 to 16 days to lose 1 kg.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
 
        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>What's the lowest calorie amount I should eat?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              Most guidelines recommend not going below 1,200 calories per day for women or 1,500 calories per day for men without medical supervision.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>How do I know how much weight I actually need to lose?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              A common starting point is picking a target weight that puts you in a healthy BMI range (roughly 18.5–24.9), then subtracting that from your current weight. Enter a target weight in the Roadmap section above and we'll calculate the total and a safe timeline for you automatically.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>How do I calculate my weight loss percentage?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              Subtract your current weight from your starting weight, divide that by your starting weight, then multiply by 100. For example, going from 90 kg to 81 kg is a 9 kg loss, or 10% of your starting body weight.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>Is it safe to lose 1 kg a week?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              For most people, yes — 1 kg a week sits at the faster end of what's generally considered sustainable, and it's one of the speed options above. Losing much faster than that usually means an unsustainably low calorie intake, which can lead to muscle loss and rebound weight gain.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-forest-light rounded-xl bg-white">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left p-4 font-body font-medium text-charcoal">
            <span>How long will it take to reach my goal weight?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon text-forest transition-transform">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer hidden px-4 pb-4">
            <p class="font-body text-gray-soft">
              It depends on how much you have to lose and how fast you choose to lose it — generally a larger total takes proportionally longer at any given safe weekly rate. Use the Roadmap feature above to get a personalized estimate along with milestones and a meal plan.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
 
